### ===================================================================
### EWMS — WORKFLOW CALLS FOR NON-PAYROLL SERVICES
### (Leave, Attendance, Employee, Project, Team, Organization)
### ===================================================================
### IMPORTANT — read before using this file:
### Unlike PayrollService, these services define NO bound OData
### actions (confirmed: no "action ..." in their .cds files, no
### this.on("SomeAction", ...) handlers in their .js files).
###
### Workflows like "approve leave", "check in/out", "approve overtime"
### are implemented as plain OData CRUD — specifically PATCH requests
### that update a status/decision field on the relevant entity. There
### is no ".../LeaveRequests('id')/LeaveService.Approve" endpoint;
### you PATCH the LeaveApprovals or LeaveRequests record directly.
###
### Each block below documents: the entity, the field being changed,
### who's allowed to change it (from *-security.cds @restrict rules),
### and a positive + negative role test case.
### ===================================================================


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: LEAVE  (base: /odata/v4/leave)
### ===================================================================
@leaveUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/leave
@leaveRequestId = 7d000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@leaveApprovalId = 7e000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 1: Approve a Leave Request
### Entity   : LeaveApprovals
### Field    : decision  (Pending -> Approved)
### Allowed  : DepartmentManager, HRExecutive, HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for mgrdept/hrperson, 403 for empjohn (employee
###            can only READ their own approval, not write it)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Approve Leave — as DepartmentManager (expect 200)
PATCH {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveApprovals('{{leaveApprovalId}}')
Authorization: Basic mgrdept:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decisionDate": "2026-08-02T12:00:00Z",
  "remarks": "Approved — coverage confirmed"
}

### 1.2 Approve Leave — as Employee (expect 403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveApprovals('{{leaveApprovalId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 2: Reject a Leave Request
### Entity   : LeaveApprovals
### Field    : decision  (Pending -> Rejected)
### Allowed  : DepartmentManager, HRExecutive, HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for hrperson, 403 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Reject Leave — as HRAdmin (expect 200)
PATCH {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveApprovals('{{leaveApprovalId}}')
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "decisionDate": "2026-08-02T12:05:00Z",
  "remarks": "Insufficient notice period"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 3: Update Leave Request Status (parent record)
### Entity   : LeaveRequests
### Field    : status  (Draft/Pending -> TeamApproved/HRApproved/
###            Rejected/Cancelled)
### Allowed  : Employee (own record, limited fields),
###            DepartmentManager (scoped to dept), HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for the employee cancelling their own request,
###            200 for HRAdmin approving (business-rule enforcement
###            happens in the handler, not shown here — @restrict
###            only gates entity-level access)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Employee Cancels Own Pending Leave Request (expect 200)
PATCH {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveRequests('{{leaveRequestId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled",
  "remarks": "Plans changed"
}

### 3.2 HRAdmin Marks Leave Request HR-Approved (expect 200)
PATCH {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveRequests('{{leaveRequestId}}')
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "HRApproved"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 4: Create Leave Request (Apply for Leave)
### Entity   : LeaveRequests
### Allowed  : Employee (own), HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 201 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Employee Applies for Leave (expect 201)
POST {{leaveUrl}}/LeaveRequests
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "leaveType_ID": "7a000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "fromDate": "2026-09-20",
  "toDate": "2026-09-21",
  "totalDays": 2.00,
  "reason": "Personal work",
  "status": "Draft"
}


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: ATTENDANCE  (base: /odata/v4/attendance)
### ===================================================================
@attUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/attendance
@attendanceId = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@overtimeId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 5: Check-In (create today's attendance record)
### Entity   : Attendances
### Allowed  : Employee (own, employee_ID = $user.employeeId),
###            HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 201 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Employee Checks In (expect 201)
POST {{attUrl}}/Attendances
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "attendanceDate": "2026-08-02",
  "shift_ID": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "checkIn": "09:00:00",
  "attendanceStatus": "Present"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 6: Check-Out (update today's attendance record)
### Entity   : Attendances
### Field    : checkOut, workedHours
### Allowed  : Employee (own), DepartmentManager (dept scope, read+
###            update), HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for empjohn updating their own row
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Employee Checks Out (expect 200)
PATCH {{attUrl}}/Attendances('{{attendanceId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkOut": "18:05:00",
  "workedHours": 8.08
}

### 6.2 Employee Tries to Edit Someone Else's Attendance (expect 403/404)
PATCH {{attUrl}}/Attendances('50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkOut": "18:05:00"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 7: Request Overtime
### Entity   : Overtimes
### Field    : status  (default "Pending")
### Allowed  : Employee (own, create+read), HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 201 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Employee Requests Overtime (expect 201)
POST {{attUrl}}/Overtimes
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "attendance_ID": "50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "approvedHours": 2.00,
  "reason": "Release deployment support",
  "status": "Pending"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 8: Approve Overtime
### Entity   : Overtimes
### Field    : status  (Pending -> Approved), approvedBy, approvedDate
### Allowed  : DepartmentManager (read+update), HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for mgrdept, 403 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Approve Overtime — as DepartmentManager (expect 200)
PATCH {{attUrl}}/Overtimes('{{overtimeId}}')
Authorization: Basic mgrdept:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "approvedBy_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "approvedDate": "2026-08-02T19:30:00Z"
}

### 8.2 Approve Overtime — as Employee (expect 403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{attUrl}}/Overtimes('{{overtimeId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: EMPLOYEE  (base: /odata/v4/employee)
### ===================================================================
@empUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/employee
@empAssignmentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 9: Reassign Employee (Transfer to New Project/Team)
### Entity   : EmployeeAssignments
### Allowed  : Read - DepartmentManager, ProjectManager, HRExecutive,
###            HRAdmin, SystemAdmin;  Write (CRUD) - HRAdmin/SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for hrperson, 403 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 HRAdmin Transfers Employee to New Project (expect 200)
PATCH {{empUrl}}/EmployeeAssignments('{{empAssignmentId}}')
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_ID": "22222222-ffff-2222-ffff-222222222222",
  "fromDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### 9.2 Employee Tries to Reassign Themselves (expect 403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{empUrl}}/EmployeeAssignments('{{empAssignmentId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_ID": "22222222-ffff-2222-ffff-222222222222"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 10: Verify an Employee Document
### Entity   : Documents
### Field    : verified, verifiedBy, verifiedOn
### Allowed  : HRAdmin, SystemAdmin (update); Employee only owns
###            create/read, not verification
### Expected : 200 for hrperson, 403 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 10.1 HRAdmin Verifies Uploaded Document (expect 200)
PATCH {{empUrl}}/Documents('00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001')
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verified": true,
  "verifiedBy": "hrperson",
  "verifiedOn": "2026-08-02T10:00:00Z"
}


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: PROJECT  (base: /odata/v4/project)
### ===================================================================
@projUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/project
@projectId = 11111111-ffff-1111-ffff-111111111111

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 11: Close a Project
### Entity   : Projects
### Field    : status  (Active -> Closed), actualEndDate
### Allowed  : ProjectManager, HRAdmin, SystemAdmin
### Expected : 200 for mgrproj, 403 for empjohn
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 11.1 ProjectManager Closes Project (expect 200)
PATCH {{projUrl}}/Projects('{{projectId}}')
Authorization: Basic mgrproj:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Closed",
  "actualEndDate": "2026-08-02"
}

### 11.2 Employee Tries to Close Project (expect 403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{projUrl}}/Projects('{{projectId}}')
Authorization: Basic empjohn:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Closed"
}


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: TEAM  (base: /odata/v4/team)
### ===================================================================
@teamUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/team
@teamId = 11111111-7777-1111-7777-111111111111

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 12: Assign a Team Manager
### Entity   : TeamManagers
### Allowed  : HRAdmin, SystemAdmin (CRUD); others read-only
### Expected : 201 for hrperson
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 12.1 HRAdmin Assigns New Team Manager (expect 201)
POST {{teamUrl}}/TeamManagers
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_ID": "{{teamId}}",
  "employeeID_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "fromDate": "2026-08-02",
  "isActive": true
}


### ===================================================================
### MODULE: ORGANIZATION  (base: /odata/v4/organization)
### ===================================================================
@orgUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/organization
@deptId = 44444444-dddd-4444-dddd-444444444444

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### WORKFLOW 13: Assign a Department HR Owner
### Entity   : DepartmentHRs
### Allowed  : HRAdmin, SystemAdmin only (both read and write)
### Expected : 201 for hrperson, 403 for mgrdept
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 13.1 HRAdmin Assigns Department HR (expect 201)
POST {{orgUrl}}/DepartmentHRs
Authorization: Basic hrperson:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_ID": "{{deptId}}",
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "fromDate": "2026-08-02",
  "isActive": true
}

### 13.2 DepartmentManager Tries Same Call (expect 403 Forbidden)
POST {{orgUrl}}/DepartmentHRs
Authorization: Basic mgrdept:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_ID": "{{deptId}}",
  "employee_ID": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "fromDate": "2026-08-02",
  "isActive": true
}


### ===================================================================
### FOR COMPARISON: PayrollService — the one module with real bound
### actions (see ewms-actions.http for the full 7-action suite):
###   POST /odata/v4/payroll/PayrollPeriods('{id}')/PayrollService.ProcessPayroll
###   POST /odata/v4/payroll/PayrollProcesses('{id}')/PayrollService.RejectPayroll
###   POST /odata/v4/payroll/Payslips('{id}')/PayrollService.PublishPayslip
###   ...etc.
### ===================================================================